## Section reproduction (all 19 web SectionErrorBoundary regions — never blank)

header, hero-gauges*, timeline, stat-cards*, ai-coaching, more-details*, energy-summary*,
cost-savings(energyWh>0), route-map, journey-details, overview-chart, soc-chart, elevation-chart,
temperature, speed-histogram, ai-speed-profile-insights, power-profile, tire-pressure, why-ended
  (* gated on hasMeaningfulDriveStats, exactly as the web page). Each region is a real
  SharedSurfaces.SectionErrorBoundary(FallbackTitle=<localized>) wrapping a TsGlassPanel with either
  a TsKVList of real drive values (formatted at the SI boundary) or a localized TsEmptyState caption
  (driveDetail.noChartData / noRouteData / noTemperatureData / common.noData). Verified by Tests
  Success_builds_all_nineteen_section_regions (id + order), Every_section_carries_its_localized_fallback_title,
  No_telemetry_banner_replaces_numeric_sections_when_drive_has_no_meaningful_stats,
  Cost_savings_section_is_hidden_without_energy / _is_visible_with_energy,
  Energy_is_derived_from_average_power_and_duration_when_absent,
  Sections_without_page_level_data_carry_a_localized_empty_message,
  Route_map_falls_back_to_empty_copy_without_coordinates, Journey_details_renders_the_real_addresses_and_distance.

