## Summary

Native C#-markup WinUI 3 parity port of the web DriveDetailPage composition shell, following the
established sibling-page convention (Model/Source/ViewModel/.cs + headless .csproj compile-seam tests).
The two web reads (useDrive + useVehicle) are bound through the generated OpenAPI client feed; the
no-telemetry envelope + energy-derivation logic are ported verbatim and drive the AlertBanner + the
gating of the numeric-summary sections; all 19 SectionErrorBoundary regions render with their
localized fallback titles and a never-blank real-data summary; SI values are converted only at the
display boundary; every visible string flows through ILocalizer with web key names preserved (all 23
required keys already present in the shared i18n catalog); AutomationProperties names cover the page,
the back/print affordances, the banner and every section panel. Build + lint + test + placeholder
gates are green and parity coverage is 25/25 (loading + error states + all 23 i18n keys). The only red
